To evaluate whether a lock works, we should establish some basic criteria:
- Provide mutual exclusion (prevent multiple threads from entering critical
  section).
- Provide fairness (each thread contending for the lock get a fair shot at
  acquiring the lock once it is free).
- Performance (the overheads added by using the lock).

